{"id":"715a32e91161b34f","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","title":"Free Variable","display":"df-free-variable — Free Variable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-free-variable","aliases":["58-df-free-variable"],"display":"df-free-variable — Free Variable","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-term.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-free-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-free-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-free-variable — Free Variable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"db7ec154138d5972\" href=\"?note=db7ec154138d5972\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-term.md\">../batch05/58-df-term.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\)</span> (signature components)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_{\\mathrm{fn}}:\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\to\\omega\">\\(a_{\\mathrm{fn}}:\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\to\\omega\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_{\\mathrm{rel}}:\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\to\\omega\">\\(a_{\\mathrm{rel}}:\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\to\\omega\\)</span> (arity maps)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (term set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"db7ec154138d5972\" href=\"?note=db7ec154138d5972\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-term.md\">../batch05/58-df-term.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (一阶公式集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S = \\{v_k \\mid k \\in \\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S = \\{v_k \\mid k \\in \\omega\\}\\)</span> (变元集)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,t_1,\\ldots,t_n\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(t,t_1,\\ldots,t_n\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (terms)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi, \\psi, \\chi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\varphi, \\psi, \\chi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (公式)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\in \\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x \\in \\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> (变量)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma \\subseteq \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\Gamma \\subseteq \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (公式集)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma\\)</span> (recursive variable-set operators defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>四分量语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 上的递归通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(L)\\)</span> 转入原五分量签名；语法对象不重新编码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable\\text{-}term\\text{-}type} \\vdash \\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma:\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable\\text{-}term\\text{-}type} \\vdash \\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma:\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable\\text{-}term} \\vdash \\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t) \\coloneqq \\begin{cases}\\{t\\},&amp;t\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\\\ \\emptyset,&amp;t\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}},\\\\ \\displaystyle\\bigcup_{i\\in a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)}\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t_i),&amp;t=f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)-1}),\\ f\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable\\text{-}term} \\vdash \\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t) \\coloneqq \\begin{cases}\\{t\\},&amp;t\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\\\ \\emptyset,&amp;t\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}},\\\\ \\displaystyle\\bigcup_{i\\in a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)}\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t_i),&amp;t=f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)-1}),\\ f\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable} \\vdash \\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi) \\coloneqq \\begin{cases}\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t_1)\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t_2),&amp;\\varphi=(t_1\\doteq t_2),\\\\ \\displaystyle\\bigcup_{i\\in a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(R)}\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t_i),&amp;\\varphi=R(t_0,\\ldots,t_{a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(R)-1}),\\ R\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\\\ \\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\psi),&amp;\\varphi=\\neg\\psi,\\\\ \\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\psi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\chi),&amp;\\varphi=(\\psi\\lor\\chi),\\\\ \\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\psi)\\setminus\\{x\\},&amp;\\varphi=\\forall x\\,\\psi.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable} \\vdash \\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi) \\coloneqq \\begin{cases}\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t_1)\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t_2),&amp;\\varphi=(t_1\\doteq t_2),\\\\ \\displaystyle\\bigcup_{i\\in a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(R)}\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t_i),&amp;\\varphi=R(t_0,\\ldots,t_{a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(R)-1}),\\ R\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\\\ \\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\psi),&amp;\\varphi=\\neg\\psi,\\\\ \\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\psi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\chi),&amp;\\varphi=(\\psi\\lor\\chi),\\\\ \\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\psi)\\setminus\\{x\\},&amp;\\varphi=\\forall x\\,\\psi.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma) \\coloneqq \\bigcup_{\\varphi\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma) \\coloneqq \\bigcup_{\\varphi\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(L)\\ \\to\\\n\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(t)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(L)}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(L)\\ \\to\\\n\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(t)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(L)}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\ \\to\\\n\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathrm{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(L)}(\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\ \\to\\\n\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathrm{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(L)}(\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\ \\to\\\n\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\varphi\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\ \\to\\\n\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\varphi\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\\)</span> 返回公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 中所有自由变元的集合。</li>\n<li>自由变元是那些不被任何量词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\">\\(\\forall x\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\">\\(\\exists x\\)</span> 约束的变元</li>\n<li>变量在原子公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_1 \\doteq t_2\">\\(t_1 \\doteq t_2\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(t_1, \\ldots, t_n)\">\\(R(t_1, \\ldots, t_n)\\)</span> 中出现即为自由</li>\n<li>量词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Qx\\,\\psi\">\\(Qx\\,\\psi\\)</span> 约束变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，将其从自由变元集中移除</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi) = \\emptyset\">\\(\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi) = \\emptyset\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 是句子（sentence）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"db7ec154138d5972\" href=\"?note=db7ec154138d5972\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-term.md\">../batch05/58-df-term.md</a> — 项与项中变量</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"44ad6dc46f3340f0\" href=\"?note=44ad6dc46f3340f0\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-bound-variable.md\">../batch19/58-df-bound-variable.md</a> — 约束变元</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"621985f38a386342\" href=\"?note=621985f38a386342\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-subformula.md\">../batch01/58-df-subformula.md</a> — 子公式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a> — 一阶公式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-term.md","status":"resolved","id":"db7ec154138d5972","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-term.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ (signature, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-term.md","status":"resolved","id":"db7ec154138d5972","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$ (term set, see [[../batch05/58-df-term.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)$ (一阶公式集, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文